                <p rendition="#flush">I <hi rendition="#italic">Recommendations of the Paris
                        Conference on the Peace Treaty With Italy</hi><anchor n="7" xml:id="d311-f1"
                        />—<hi rendition="#italic">Continuation of the Discussion</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Articles 3, 4, and 16</hi></p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">decided</hi> to adjourn consideration of the
                    recommendations on Articles 3, 4, and 16 until the next discussion of the draft
                    Peace Treaty <pb facs="1094" n="1070" xml:id="pg1070"/> with Italy, which it was
                        <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> would be held after the Council had
                    discussed the Paris Conference recommendations with regard to the draft Treaties
                    with Roumania, Bulgaria, Hungary, and Finland and any other points on those
                    Treaties which the Members of the Council might wish to raise.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 14</hi></p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to adopt Article 14 as it appears in
                    the Draft Treaty.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 14</hi>(<hi rendition="#italic">A</hi>)</p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to refer the recommendation on this
                    Article to the Deputies who should submit an agreed text for the approval of the
                    Council.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">New Article, between Articles 14 and 15 Fascist
                        Organizations</hi></p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to adopt as a basis the first part of
                    the draft text of this Article up to the words “democratic rights,” and to refer
                    the article to the Deputies to prepare a new draft connecting it with Article 30
                    of the Armistice Agreement with Italy and to submit this draft for the approval
                    of the Council.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 25</hi>(<hi rendition="#italic">A</hi>)</p>
                <p>There was an exchange of views on this article.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Annex III</hi></p>
                <p>It was agreed to refer Annex III to the Economic Experts for study.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Annex VII</hi> [<hi rendition="#italic">Parts I, II, and
                        IV</hi>]<anchor n="8" xml:id="d311-f2"/></p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to refer Annex VII, Parts I, II, and
                    IV, to the Economic Experts for study.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 64, Part D, Reparation for other Powers</hi></p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to refer Part D of Article 64, which
                    had in principle been adopted by the Council of Foreign Ministers, to the
                    Economic Experts for drafting.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II <hi rendition="#italic">Recommendations of the Pans
                        Conference on the Draft Peace Treaty With Roumania</hi><anchor n="9"
                        xml:id="d311-f3"/>—<hi rendition="#italic">First Reading</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 3</hi>(<hi rendition="#italic">A</hi>)</p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this Article was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 14</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this Article was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 24, para. 4</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this paragraph was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 24, para. 8C2</hi></p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to refer the question of a definition
                    of the term “United Nations shipping” to the Economic Experts for
                    consideration.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 24 bis</hi></p>
                <pb facs="1095" n="1071" xml:id="pg1071"/>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this Article was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 26</hi></p>
                <p>The Conference recommendation on this Article was <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >adopted</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 27</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this Article was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 30, paragraphs 1c and 2</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on these paragraphs was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 30 bis</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this Article was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 31</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this Article was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 34</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this Article was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 36</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this Article was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting of the
                    Council</hi></p>
                <p>Monday, November 11, 10:30 a.m.</p>
                <closer>
